	\begin{enumerate}
		\item\ollabel{Closurehaselem} $B \subseteq \Closureofunder{f}{B}$؛ تے
		\item\ollabel{Closureclosed} $\Closureofunder{f}{B}$، $f$-بند اے؛ تے
