\emph{سیٹاں دے} سیٹ، یعنی $\Pow{\Nat \times \Nat}$،
!!{nonenumerable} اے۔
\end{prob}

source.excerpt:
\begin{prob}
Show that $\Nat^\omega$, the set of infinite sequences of natural
numbers, is !!{nonenumerable} by a reduction argument.
\end{prob}

